1
00:00:00,130 --> 00:00:05,310
So while I was in Kenya with One Love Chapel Club, I got the opportunity to visit a school in an underprivileged settlement in Nairobi,

2
00:00:05,730 --> 00:00:08,610
and I offered to pay the school fees for 28 students to go to high school.

3
00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:13,470
Now, in Kenya, you have to pay for school from primary to middle to high school.

4
00:00:14,110 --> 00:00:19,810
And of course, many people do not have that money, but I truly believe that education is the key to our liberation.

5
00:00:20,570 --> 00:00:25,010
And in innumerable cases, education is the key to being able to get out of poverty.

6
00:00:25,010 --> 00:00:29,310
So when I learned that I would be able to afford this, I jumped at the opportunity to do so,

7
00:00:29,410 --> 00:00:36,030
and I'm very proud and honored to be able to help these individuals, 28 of them, to change their lives, their family lives, their legacies, etc.

8
00:00:36,250 --> 00:00:40,410
So when I see comments like this, where someone says, well, we have students here in America, why aren't you helping them?

9
00:00:40,730 --> 00:00:46,190
Well, first of all, I do help them, but I also understand that we have a very different situation here in America than in other places like Kenya.

10
00:00:46,350 --> 00:00:52,130
I also understand that there's a very big difference in someone being able to attend college and someone being able to attend high school.

11
00:00:52,130 --> 00:01:00,590
And for me, the ability to be able to impact 28 lives where in America I may be able to impact like one or two, I'm going to jump at that opportunity.

12
00:01:01,150 --> 00:01:05,650
Then there's this idiot who said, I agree with your perspective and anyone who says different deep down agrees too.

13
00:01:05,750 --> 00:01:09,750
They live in a whole continent where their leader is Black African and yet still they need help.

14
00:01:10,050 --> 00:01:11,390
They are not oppressed at all.

15
00:01:11,470 --> 00:01:15,230
They just face Black corrupted leaders, which I'm sure they could resolve if they woke up.

16
00:01:15,490 --> 00:01:16,730
So yeah, I agree with your perspective.

17
00:01:16,950 --> 00:01:18,110
Okay, okay, okay.

18
00:01:18,550 --> 00:01:20,310
This is giving our ancestors chose slavery.

19
00:01:20,310 --> 00:01:25,570
Folks, the reality is, is that everyone everywhere is having this difficult time.

20
00:01:25,670 --> 00:01:27,070
And if you can help, do so.

